[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/154","id":5166738634,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVESuUM8AAAABM_Ysyg","html_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/154","diff_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/154.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/gmkurtzer/ginux/pull/154.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/154","number":154,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"ginux: connect native fork/exec/threads/waits/pipes to managed supervision","user":{"login":"veighnsche","id":16469623,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY5NjIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16469623?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche","html_url":"https://github.com/veighnsche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/veighnsche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"human: Implementation planned by GPT-6.1 Sol high -  implemented and PR submitted by muse spark 1.3 max - reviewed and fixed by GPT-6 astra high.\r\n\r\n## Dependency notice (read first)\r\n\r\nThis branch is stacked directly on `ginux-recipe/g01-launch` (`d1e14bb1`, PR #153, pending review). The diff below therefore includes #153's commits. **Please review only the 6 commits in `d1e14bb1..b3c53518`** (7 files); I will retarget this PR onto `main` once #153 lands. Do not treat the stacked diff as one feature.\r\n\r\n## What this does\r\n\r\nGeneral native process supervision. On top of the configured launch/result-file loop from #153, it connects the existing managed task model (`ginx-process::ProcessTable`) to the real native supervision loop (`process-native` path):\r\n\r\n- fork creates managed parent/child ownership; fixture exit-23/32 rules replaced by `ProcessTable::wait` translation; host pids never exposed.\r\n- libc creation variants: raw `clone`, `vfork`, `clone(CLONE_VM|CLONE_VFORK)` share the managed path; `CLONE_THREAD` and bare `CLONE_VM` denied `ENOSYS`; `clone3` untouched so glibc falls back.\r\n- `execve` / plain `execveat(AT_FDCWD,…,0)` execute under supervision (`TRACEEXEC` + `PTRACE_EVENT_EXEC`, same virtual pid, bumped exec epoch); other `execveat` shapes denied `ENOSYS`.\r\n- Supported `CLONE_THREAD` shape via `clone_thread`; return/parent-tid-cell/`gettid` translated, `getpid` reports tgid; `arch_prctl`/futex/robust/rseq mediated on host; futex-joined thread exit, root exit drains live threads.\r\n- `wait4` fully emulated (blocking park, `WNOHANG`→0, `EINVAL`/`ECHILD`); `kill` forwards SIGTERM/SIGINT/SIGKILL + signal-0 probe; SIGCHLD queued/delivered per child death.\r\n- Supervisor-owned pipe mirror: pipe/pipe2/dup/dup2/dup3/close + fcntl subset; CLOEXEC scrubbed at exec; task death releases ends; teardown audits `live-pipes=0`.\r\n\r\n## Demonstration (all supervised, needs root for ptrace/chroot)\r\n\r\n```\r\ncargo build -p ginux-init --target x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu --release\r\nsudo ./target/x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu/release/ginux process-native config/domain-gate7.toml /tmp/g03-repro/forkstatus   # G03_REPRO: PASS\r\n# .../exec-shell   # SHELL_REPRO: PASS\r\n# .../thread-repro # THREAD_REPRO: PASS (2 threads, join + detach, 7 denials)\r\n# .../wait-repro   # WAIT_REPRO: PASS (exits 42,3; signals 15,9)\r\n# .../pipe-repro   # PIPE_REPRO: PASS (live-pipes=0)\r\n```\r\nEach run also ends `GATE7_NATIVE_PROCESS: PASS`, exit 0, no surviving tracees. Launch-loop side from #153 still intact on the same binary.\r\n\r\n## Stated limitations (not fixed here)\r\n\r\n- Supervision lives in the `process-native` loop; convergence into the `launch` loop is follow-up work.\r\n- In-tracee SIGCHLD handlers need `rt_sigaction` mediation; job control unmediated.\r\n- Real-libc shell pipelines still need file/memory mediation; acceptance uses raw static stages.\r\n- `clone3`/`chown` denied; hardlinks are content copies.\r\n- One commit also deletes a prohibited `#[cfg(test)]` suite in `ginx-process/src/lib.rs`; kept and flagged rather than separated — happy to split it into a standalone commit on request.","created_at":"2026-11-05T05:36:31Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T05:48:07Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1d8cfd6e78452413a13ed2cd4863272d0de175ca","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/154/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/154/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/issues/154/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gmkurtzer/ginux/statuses/b3c53518b206ee4a3d90f84cea9726458d77a87a","head":{"label":"LevitateOS:ginux-recipe/u02-process","ref":"ginux-recipe/u02-process","sha":"b3c53518b206ee4a3d90f84cea9726458d77a87a","user":{"login":"LevitateOS","id":254183835,"node_id":"O_kgDODyaJmw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254183835?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LevitateOS","html_url":"https://github.com/LevitateOS","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LevitateOS/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LevitateOS/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LevitateOS/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.git